                                                "sense_id": "0192d219-b088-3d35-8029-31168a5d8557",
                                                "text": "And on the tables every clime and age / Jumbled together: celts and calumets, / Claymore and snow-shoe, toys in lava, fans / Of sandal, amber, ancient rosaries[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
